"<xref linkend=\"gsettings-desktop-schemas\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libcanberra\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libinput\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libpcap\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/> e <xref linkend=\"xorg-"
"wacom-driver\"/> (para wacomtablet), <xref linkend=\"linux-pam\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"lm_sensors\"/>, <xref linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"pciutils\"/>, <xref linkend=\"power-profiles-daemon\"/>, e os "
"seguintes módulos Python: <xref linkend=\"psutil\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"pygdbmi\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sentry-sdk\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"urllib3\"/> (se não estiverem instalados, eles serão baixados e "
"instalados pelo procedimento de construção do drkonqi)"

